#: contributing/pr_workflow.rst:352
msgid "Issuing a pull request"
msgstr ""

#: contributing/pr_workflow.rst:354
msgid ""
"When you load your fork's branch on GitHub, you should see a line saying "
"*\"This branch is 2 commits ahead of RebelToolbox:main.\"* (and potentially "
