#: development/editor/introduction_to_editor_development.rst:76
msgid ""
"Currently, there are some dependencies to ``editor/`` includes in ``scene/`` "
"files, see `Github issue <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"issues/29730>`__."
msgstr ""

