msgid ""
"A tree structure is not enough to represent the whole scene. Rebel Engine "
"uses a ``NodePath(Path/To/Node)`` structure to refer to another node or "
"attribute of the node anywhere in the scene tree. For instance, MeshInstance "
"uses ``NodePath()`` to point to its skeleton. Likewise, Animation tracks use "
"``NodePath()`` to point to node properties to animate."
