#: getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:41
msgid ""
"**GDScript**: Classes (nodes) use PascalCase, variables and functions use "
"snake_case, and constants use ALL_CAPS (See :doc:`/tutorials/scripting/"
"gdscript/gdscript_styleguide`)."
msgstr ""

#: getting_started/first_2d_game/02.player_scene.rst:45
msgid ""
"**C#**: Classes, export variables and methods use PascalCase, private fields "
"use _camelCase, local variables and parameters use camelCase (See :doc:`/"
"tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_style_guide`). Be careful to type the "
"method names precisely when connecting signals."
