#: tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:303
msgid "Emission Shapes"
msgstr ""

#: tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:305
msgid ""
"ParticlesMaterials allow you to set an Emission Mask, which dictates the "
