"another CSGCylinder and adjust the dimensions to use it as a pole."
msgstr ""

#: tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:198
msgid ""
"We will use a CSGPolygon for the lampshade. Use the **Spin** mode for the "
"CSGPolygon and draw a `trapezoid <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Trapezoid>`__ while in **Front View** (numeric keypad 1); this shape will "
"extrude around the origin and form the lampshade."
msgstr ""

