#: tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:6
msgid ""
"Some developers like using the command line extensively. Rebel Engine is "
"designed to be friendly to them, so here are the steps for working entirely "
"from the command line. Given the engine relies on almost no external "
"libraries, initialization times are pretty fast, making it suitable for this "
