#: tutorials/export/exporting_for_android.rst:102
msgid ""
"Launcher icons are used by Android launcher apps to represent your "
"application to users. Rebel Editor only requires high-resolution icons (for "
"``xxxhdpi`` density screens) and will automatically generate lower-"
"resolution variants."
