"Rebel Engine uses them extensively. Developing a good understanding of "
"vector math is essential to becoming a strong game developer."
msgstr ""

#: tutorials/math/vector_math.rst:13
msgid ""
"This tutorial is **not** a formal textbook on linear algebra. We will only "
"be looking at how it is applied to game development. For a broader look at "
