#: tutorials/plugins/editor/spatial_gizmos.rst:64
msgid ""
"The first step is to, in our custom gizmo plugin, override the :ref:"
"`has_gizmo()<class_EditorSpatialGizmoPlugin_method_has_gizmo>` method so "
