#: tutorials/vr/openvr/vr_starter_tutorial_part_two.rst:914
msgid ""
"Expand the ``GUI`` :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` node and then select the "
"``Base_Control`` node. Add a new script called ``Base_Control.gd``, and add "
"the following:"
